              "value": "Blood Drain"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Requirements: The mandragora has a creature grabbed\n\nThe mandragora drains blood from the creature it has grabbed, dealing 2d6 damage. If the creature is a demon, fey, or sorcerer, the mandragora gains temporary Hit Points equal to the damage dealt. A creature that has its blood drained by a mandragora is drained 1 until it receives healing of any kind or amount."
